{
  "_about": [
    "Observations made by eye against the video, and the wall scoreboard read",
    "from the stream. This is the only ground truth in the project that was not",
    "produced by the detector, which is why it is kept here rather than left in",
    "a conversation: every automated measure of recall so far has been circular,",
    "because the YOLO model was trained on labels the classical detector wrote.",
    "Times are seconds into the stream. 'confirms' entries record a pipeline",
    "output that a human checked and agreed with; 'refutes' entries record one",
    "that a human checked and rejected."
  ],
