          "topic": "box area does not separate stones from people",
          "note": "Across all 13 ends, detections holding a spot (stones) measure area p10 457 / median 483 / p90 508, and transient detections p10 378 / median 475 / p90 517. The medians are all but identical, so no area gate is available. The clean gap visible in g2e1 8113-8139 (stones 473-531, shoes 372-460) is local. The comparison is also blunt: 'transient' includes stones in flight as well as people."
